# Flok API routes

- Validate every input. Return `{ error: string, code: string }` on failure.
- Bot auth uses token hashes (`FLOK_TOKEN_SECRET`); never log or return raw tokens.
- Rate-limit claims and pulses; keep seed gated (`FLOK_ALLOW_SEED`, non-production).
- Internal path names may stay `birds` / `chirps` until an approved rename.
- No Redis / queues / websockets / payments until BUILD economy gates (E2+).
